      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, witness clauses",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>The slave recognizes the validity of that.</li>\n<li>Written by B\u016b al-Ghamr ibn Ma\u02bf\u0101l\u012b,</li>\n<li>on its date.</li>\n<li>The slave recognizes the validity of that.</li>\n<li>Written by al-Mufa\u1e0d\u1e0dal, son of the Rabbanite al-Mask\u012bl,</li>\n<li>on its date.</li></ol>\n",
